# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# The device build runs under Linux or WSL through tools/bootstrap-ndless.sh
# and the Ndless SDK's shell wrappers. A CRLF checkout on Windows turns those
# scripts into syntax errors, so line endings are not left to core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ppm binary
*.tns binary
*.zehn binary
